The preflight reached its clean-build subcheck but failed immediately because the ambient `lake` installation cannot detect its configuration. This is not yet a proof verdict: I’m diagnosing the trusted toolchain environment and will rerun with the pinned Lean/Lake installation if it is available. The failed output is preserved verbatim in evidence.
